<title>LATVIA: INVESTMENT BANK 6-MO PROFIT 140,000 LATS.</title>
<headline>INVESTMENT BANK 6-MO PROFIT 140,000 LATS.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Latvian Investment Bank said on Thursday that its six month after-tax profit came to 140,000 lats against 7,800 lats profit for the whole of 1996.</p>
<p>The bank said that its loan portfolio was 11.7 million lats, compared with five million lats in January.</p>
<p>The Investment bank, an institution of the government and the European Bank for Reconstruction and Development (EBRD), directs loan funds to medium and small-sized companies.</p>
<p>-- Martinsh Gravitis, Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
